Output demo.gif
Output demo.mp4
Set Shell zsh
Set FontFamily "Menlo"
Set FontSize 16
Set Width 1280
Set Height 760
Set Padding 24
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set WaitTimeout 180s
Set TypingSpeed 40ms
Set PlaybackSpeed 1.3

Hide
Type "cd ~/dev/mk-demo && clear" Enter
Show
Type "claude" Enter
Sleep 9s
Type "morning. where are we with Nestlé?"
Sleep 1s
Enter
Wait+Screen@180s /Tuesday/
Sleep 7s

Type "the client came back: no em-dash in the pricing headline, a full stop instead"
Sleep 1s
Enter
# Claude Code's one-per-session sensitive-file prompt for .claude/memory — answered off camera
Hide
Wait+Screen@180s /Do you want to (make this edit|proceed)/
Sleep 1s
Type "2" Enter
Sleep 1s
Show
Wait+Screen@180s /saved:/
Sleep 6s

Type "now IKEA. what's due this week? and Anna wants the weekly status on Thursdays from now on"
Sleep 1s
Enter
Wait+Screen@180s /catalog/
Sleep 8s

Type "that's all for today, wrap up"
Sleep 1s
Enter
Wait+Screen@180s /PROPOSAL:/
Sleep 7s
Type "yes"
Sleep 1s
Enter
Wait+Screen@180s /Session closed\./
Sleep 7s

Hide
Type "/exit" Enter
Sleep 4s
Type "clear" Enter
Sleep 1s
Show
Type "claude" Enter
Sleep 9s
Type "next morning. what did we settle about em-dashes for Nestlé, and when is the IKEA status due now?"
Sleep 1s
Enter
Wait+Screen@180s /Thursday/
Sleep 9s
